title: Land Reform
subtitle: Agriculture: parcellation with compensation, a faster parcellation or land first for Polish settlers.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_land.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'land_program') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.land_program (technical reference 12.6, 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.8). Opening and closing the card are
// free; a confirmed option costs this month's action and starts the parcellation at once, its law going to the Sejm. Z — 0.97 (the
// sketch of 7 XI 2026, decision 1): the preference for Polish settlers is the third option instead of the page of access to land,
// and the expropriation without compensation, blocked in this chapter, left the card.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'land_program');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_land');
!}

= Land reform

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The land reform divides the great estates among peasants and farm workers. Each parcellation covers one of three parts of the country. [+ pl_gc_land_left +]

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @compensated
- @accelerated
- @settlers
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@compensated
title: Divide the land with compensation
subtitle: Costs 2 budget units a month for four months and needs a law. The agrarian pressure falls (−3) and the peasants are less aggrieved (−4), but the landowners and business press on the cabinet (+8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'land_program', 'compensated').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_program_compensated_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'land_program', 'compensated');
!}
go-to: result

@accelerated
title: Divide the land quickly and compulsorily
subtitle: Costs 3 budget units a month for three months and needs a law. The same effect comes a month earlier, but the resistance of business is greater (+12). [+ pl_land_program_accelerated_coalition +]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'land_program', 'accelerated').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_program_accelerated_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'land_program', 'accelerated');
!}
go-to: result

@settlers
title: Give priority to Polish settlers
subtitle: Like the parcellation with compensation, but the land goes first to Poles, and PSL Piast is pleased (+5). The minorities lose trust (−6); if we promised their clubs equality, we break that promise.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'land_program', 'settlers').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_land_program_settlers_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'land_program', 'settlers');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Land reform

